{"channelId":"UCTwBwphfi4cVwgGkTeZJLnw","row":["Mindful Massage & Bodywork",13,"Welcome to Mindful Massage and Bodywork\nYour sanctuary for healing, relaxation, and whole-body renewal.\n\nThis channel is dedicated to helping you reconnect with your body through intentional touch, mindful movement, and expert bodywork techniques. Whether you're a wellness seeker, massage therapist, or just curious about natural ways to feel better in your body—you're in the right place.\n\n✨ Here you’ll find:\n\nSelf-care routines for pain relief and stress reduction\n\nGuided breathwork and body awareness practices\n\nTutorials and education on body rolling and fitness.\n\nInsights into holistic healing modalities like Rossiter, Yamuna Body Rolling, and more\n\nTips to support mobility, alignment, and nervous system health\n\n\nTake a deep breath. Slow down. Tune in.\nSubscribe and join us on a journey toward greater ease, balance, and embodied wellness.\n\n#MindfulMassage #BodyworkHealing #WellnessFromWithin","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTwBwphfi4cVwgGkTeZJLnw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTwBwphfi4cVwgGkTeZJLnw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:51.506Z","channelId":"UCTwBwphfi4cVwgGkTeZJLnw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"1e7651d311b56dbe87e9b60e75153c2c5f0cbc5c59f6df2ee9cb2996ed7e5cab","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"12621a492f1f13e2280c43d5555c53cf259e81a7dc479ffe44487b19416f8dec"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTwBwphfi4cVwgGkTeZJLnw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":13,"raw":"13 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTwBwphfi4cVwgGkTeZJLnw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:51.506Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["massage therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["massage therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false